* *Root Cause:* {Direct technical cause identified in code/infra}
* *Impacted Service:* {Service name & endpoint}

h3. 2. Telemetry & Evidence Chain
* *Failing HTTP Request:* {{code}}{METHOD} {URL} -> HTTP {STATUS}{{code}}
* *Correlation ID:* {{code}}{correlationId}{{code}}
* *Datadog Environment:* {EU (app.datadoghq.com) | US (app.ddog-gov.com)}
* *Trace ID / Span:* {{code}}{traceId}{{code}}
* *Exception & Stack Trace:*
{code:java}
{exception class and key stack trace lines}
{code}
* *GitLab Repository Reference:* {{code}}{filepath}:{line}{{code}} (Commit / MR: {hash})

h3. 3. Detailed Root Cause Explanation
{Detailed explanation of how the input triggered the exception in code}

h3. 4. Confidence Breakdown
* Correlation Linkage: {score}/30
* Concrete Stack Trace: {score}/30
* Code Logic Verification: {score}/20
